{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:76d6e85695af13fcb8c6dbc4d6bde0b9bc2f0b36dcc489d0969434fb947b47ea",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7639ff47369e43196b725e424eb93e57f2397e5b05aed906fc6794a4599141",
      "text": "如今最热衷的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f474ed1ecde78084868b445e0f16027d0d363fed162c397616ed33a3e302574",
      "text": "秀最近沉迷于手机。\n有些在意的制作人在秀的邀请下，\n下载了某款应用程序。\n秀教了制作人玩法，\n制作人还将一同前往线下活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7639ff47369e43196b725e424eb93e57f2397e5b05aed906fc6794a4599141",
      "text": "如今最热衷的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e774663cb09cb17df528913935e26cb2e40db9ac4f77bc1535f41b19697dc98",
      "text": "嗯？12点了吗。等休息了，\n去看看公告页面的更新吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6499ea612b523e76d4f74d2aac5f4f3961fcd36a4981ade1fe61775cdb56db6a",
      "text": "啊，已经12点了啊。得去抽卡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fe360da9cfa0fb5aca892bccebb1f44820be6cb567fbf03312323ccb4b173a3",
      "text": "已经12点了啊。\n得把今天的任务做完才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff5615fe6bea240e210bfae384c4d8c84905925d3f53b04d7e983b5606541d6",
      "text": "（秀先生最近很沉迷手机呢。\n到底在玩什么呢……好在意！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34171c38c012747e54a06b5905194508d1ca6539a0c8c3bd359f2aa4cfef0318",
      "text": "秀先生，一到这个时间就会很在意手机呢。\n是有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f83f3bbb3886a111e7baac8d738684a3ef2595b8f11450b2ed1a201ce120f2",
      "text": "啊，这个？是游戏啦。\n马上要办线下活动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4717b47da2f7c3bb19fb5a0c97eaf892705450b1647485f91a683a49d4a2f09",
      "text": "而且活动跟游戏内是联动的，一到12点\n就会更新新的公告和任务。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c58bebde0bf27b8085aaed02e738827f1e30ee2d1fc0ceaa270b4fdb7364452",
      "text": "原来如此。是能让人这么着迷的\n有趣游戏啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8690749f95c9112270be0fcba45b1e6edf92946150199068caf26a1e872e8e16",
      "text": "嗯。\n是现在我心里最热衷的奇幻RPG。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21805807021769b945c901dca47ddb27d4a690a713bc97788ef91f12020b4e62",
      "text": "要是在意的话，你也一起去活动现场吗？\n就算不了解应该也会觉得挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81496f70458c3fbc9d2aa7606c113974f0f384640206e0b05b06b14396189fab",
      "text": "可以吗？那就拜托了！\n我这就去下载应用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca853a5bb373a21d2d5bb6c5e1cf37e5c3bd5df2068929a460aef0df7fa11723",
      "text": "玩法由我来教你。\n很简单，应该很快就能学会吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:712857884e9772364fa0f58e2925e1a65b77eb2b3e9c197d4bdbedf8a0f285b9",
      "text": "这个游戏是回合制战斗。\n把你新手教程抽到的角色给我看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b19ab27ce06e73c9c909c00eca5d2ef7d7074390e384f53096275c95b09a2546",
      "text": "……手气挺不错的嘛。按喜欢的角色来选也是一种办法，\n但一开始还是均衡选择属性会比较有利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6537dc761151bb024f047d5affa6dbdb9067a390a235254c4db63865a43a6ae0",
      "text": "新手的话，推荐这个和这个的搭配。\n就算是忙碌的你，也能在短时间内培养起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d15073d2e4d47d91cc8466ee3bd774e20e3450b83ab66543ae1fb0d27f651c1",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n秀先生推荐的角色，好可爱啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9afc5b878506b5485c97f7002f36e4d4adf9ec92c5a1e1d8d53a342be719b422",
      "text": "秀先生平时都用什么角色呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac9f2da7657c876598542127bde4fe11745f10099fdd756d4ef956fef4cd0fc6",
      "text": "最常用的是这个。虽然是个年纪跟我差不多的男角色。\n但性格超级有攻击性，挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45ba2b34c14fbdd469a0218a5f320ad082658b0a14ec133d56624b4f97d8779",
      "text": "不过，他有自己明确的原则。\n是个讲道理、很帅气的家伙哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ba427b2a618e8c3da226b4297f34ce38bfa035b1e29e8dda28ae630fd36b3cf",
      "text": "而且在全角色里也是顶级的力量数值。\n只要上了增益就能靠蛮力碾压获胜，所以效率很高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398a306f3c0bbb7679ef61db09cfe77358795f6ab9bceb6e257b3fa690adf5a7",
      "text": "虽然我也喜欢制定策略去战斗，\n但赶时间的时候就特别喜欢用这个角色吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716ef3b65f2681ad035571267179d84fa10fd82a8b10f1340fa611144aaea88f",
      "text": "原来如此！是会根据不同场合，\n来分别使用不同的角色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:942811f5c1be8bce6c7115a9d5ee6d7043cdc8a5c82805f6bd1fc42857a4d2da",
      "text": "谢谢你。我会参考你教给我的内容，\n试着去组建卡组的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1651cd1d27f13779c229a131a107b4d5056c0f360095e9fdb38e2ba7c339c026",
      "text": "又、又输了……\n明明秀先生教了我那么多的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566407e10ead194f99e9a9e62dd826ec8e556343d66e1f6a14db08906cf8e70d",
      "text": "噗……啊哈哈！●●●●プロデューサー，\n你也太沮丧了吧。作为新手来说已经很不错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36cf89ea65d9bebc9af75f74f952219499ce4cd8da3dadc8b79684d8b7f92c8",
      "text": "这套卡组组合得也挺好的。\n只是跟碰到的敌人相性太差罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab3ff034b24b0f22c4a5b459e295ea27afc9306d10da582ef26329137cb41c9",
      "text": "只要再把卡片强化一下，以你的水平\n很快就能赢了。毕竟你领悟得很快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f081e834f46576bd9e8550f41701d6bc311c6a8191afd26ca72c72b9e81826c",
      "text": "真的吗？听秀先生这么一说，\n感觉自己好像能行了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e8ef562c18eac4c7ea351a0f5577ea00b9842cb3641807a31133abcc55783a",
      "text": "话说回来，\n秀先生真的很擅长夸奖别人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:179e429716c5c475b1b0338a880876c6869ffb09d0fcd90c386625b45b8f3f8d",
      "text": "啊，我家爷爷和奶奶\n总喜欢夸我，可能被他们传染了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c67e87558945c55c3815cc168da389bb803f048c61193993ae71a5a44a49414",
      "text": "大概因为我是独生子，所以很宠我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aada1332d36f1616eff5a886bc1e370cffbb999264906a8dced592f695ecae9c",
      "text": "我想是因为秀先生有很多优点，\n才让人忍不住想多夸夸你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b194599a0965d25ce11289e2f37eca12617b75595509e7b86f9799c3a7726c",
      "text": "……我的事先别管了。快看，\n任务完成了，去领道具吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e26c6f18be01ae7bff99d1267b4a0c3d76eba8c5db64421275219f574dd4d82",
      "text": "说是要实装新主线了。而且，\n之前限定的角色也会复刻！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b9b9bd5ac750343dda443daed3a0d850de2476778daab77fbc59a3a317ac099",
      "text": "PV也超级帅气呢。\n看得我心里一阵激动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e69d84c64eee7fcc70846a89bc5555139a255e1a2fb785ad11e9855440708a2d",
      "text": "是吧！活动关卡也要开始了，\n针对新敌人重新组一套卡组吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a34595af7e24ee08c91691f418613de471810384c2fe5df89b5057fce204906",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，来电话了……\n我先离开一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42cab11bb0e38819e9a7e8e902604cf44cc1839743d340a391f8f88a5ceb701e",
      "text": "知道了。我就在这附近等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1f439e4cb4fa579db2d9652dad71a6f0c6389c3b09135610537c6540df251b5",
      "text": "（在●●●●プロデューサー回来之前，\n看看卡组吧。嗯——为了应对下次活动的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db42ea094e0032e057c31978720a0e996209336a9fc0cfe577624e750b9db701",
      "text": "（现有卡牌之外，果然还是想要特攻角色啊。\n要是抽卡能抽出来就好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80d2accb08d29cda77f9f24d3863427dbc46cc9ad485684b9fb9f267f10447b0",
      "text": "……Hey, what's up？\nAre you on your own？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02af82e0c466a8df7f574d8fa0a38fac47023be91cebd1cbe859ba4f4b9af022",
      "text": "Wanna hangout？\n……啊——要、一起玩玩吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8a207c93ddfe31cd7b17f5126ad942ddb75e711372b9cbffee9b77b1cf81e2",
      "text": "（啊，原来是搭讪啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57990cf21d02cfdcf1a8b471f157ebd0b9f4ac5b6bf15dbe0c4a0dee622ce46a",
      "text": "Actually, I'm waiting for someone.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3abb248bbb28bf1a6572b4151e2946feefd6d62ad5ecaebd19bb60653c428e",
      "text": "不好意思，让您久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:256281ee161f1f934b7d4742423c834ec4892296bb8ae56cc0fde4c702e9ee0f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，你真慢啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc699b482e540e442fa18c54ab60ca594ab451901eecb73227de1af9a0aeebab",
      "text": "I'm already booked.\nNot looking for a relationship.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc794a26585d2250b11d2d4f7f6a134c9c05c6e608fa79ad53e8db29cb59b633",
      "text": "Thanks anyway.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dbf626324a54634812029b5edf5c20159a304e2f3d7a93f2a738ca0d2787684",
      "text": "咦？刚才那两位，已经没事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb60d34777bdcf7e7843bb86fafc124cb06849a18b48109e19807c65e647654",
      "text": "没事，就是类似搭讪的而已。\n比起那个，回去的电车上继续刚才的话题吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92d049573421a4e2cbf6f13d4b123412ebdbf9d596f4df6640523883f1511b2e",
      "text": "在等你的时候，\n我想到了一个想试试看的卡组。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
